<title>USA: COHR names Morford President and COO.</title>
<headline>COHR names Morford President and COO.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>COHR Inc, an outsourcing company that provides equipment servicing, group purchasing and other products, said on Thursday is has named Sandy Morford as its new president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Morford has been at COHR for over 17 years, starting as an clinical engineer.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details.</p>
